= Alice on YamiNet
A small multi-page site served from one directory by one local node.
:: Pages on this node
  > ynp://127.0.0.1:7301/about | About Alice
  > ynp://127.0.0.1:7301/projects | Projects
:: Neighbours
  Bob runs a second node on port 7302.
  > ynp://127.0.0.1:7302/home | Visit Bob's home page
  > ynp://127.0.0.1:7302/garden | Bob's garden log
